error[V0304]: `name_of` calls itself, directly or through other functions, so it cannot return part of `user`; return a copy instead, with `.clone()`
 --> crates/varyk/tests/fixtures/errors/v0304_part_of_param_in_recursive_function/main.vr:9:5
